  "question": {
    "text": "A simple pendulum of length <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> is placed between the plates of a parallel plate capacitor having electric field <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math> , as shown in figure. Its bob has mass <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and charge <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> . The time period of the pendulum is given by:<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0182_62a90cb928b7.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 285px;\" />"
  },
